--- create meta-mine:classes-global/site_policy.bbclass
# site_policy.bbclass
#
# Logic shared by the configurations that inherit this class.
#
# Use: INHERIT += "site_policy" in a configuration file.
#
# Interface (weak defaults, ?=; set them in the recipe to override):
#   SITE_POLICY_LEVEL  default "strict"
#   SITE_POLICY_EXTRA  default ""

SITE_POLICY_LEVEL ?= "strict"
SITE_POLICY_EXTRA ?= ""
note: enable it with INHERIT += "site_policy" in a distro or local configuration (meta-mine:classes-global/site_policy.bbclass)
